      "message": "examples: exit with failure if signature verification fails\n\nThe ecdsa and schnorr examples print whether the signature is valid\nbut return EXIT_SUCCESS either way. Since the examples are run as tests\nby both build systems, a regression that broke verification would go\nunnoticed there. The musig example already fails in this case.",
